                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a nice little VR movie short experience.  It's clearly targeted for kids, so adults probably will not get as much from this experience.  It runs at around 5 minutes.  The cool thing about this app is that you can view this normal sized, giant sized, or ant sized.  So getting those different perspectives on the action is interesting.  You can also teleport to different locations to get a different angle.  The experience is narrated, the narrator's voice is adequate.  The DLC is just a thank you for the dev if you enjoyed the experience.\n\nRate 6/10 it's free and I'm sure kids would like it",
